{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_07_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "fd8bdab38abff4165fdbc34d098522fb635ad5b27729b0d4871021ff0df11ea9", "ja": "ありがとうございました！", "zh": "谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_07_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "c139c3fc4c8ac08ef518f180f7a61019ffab3885ee85e023a840f3eb7c52ec66", "ja": "みんな、改めてお疲れ様！\nなんだかあっという間だったね。", "zh": "大家，再次辛苦各位了！\n感觉时间过得真快呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_07_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "a96aa4a9603b57abc922095a8cc5bca36cd7e6b78f13d07e96f33024f3b43191", "ja": "はい。普段自分が過ごしてる世界とは違う景色が\n見られて、楽しい撮影でしたよね。", "zh": "是的。能看到与平时生活的世界不同的景色，这次拍摄真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "02da4fef8877c2293dac9319bd419334dcd9bf88f41a3273af3808ec27ad35fa", "ja": "みんな、改めて本当にお疲れ様！\n朋花と紬も、仕事の後なのに来てくれてありがとうな！", "zh": "大家，再次由衷地道一声辛苦了！\n朋花和紬也是，明明刚结束工作还特意赶过来，谢谢你们啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_07_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b454dbb4de06eeea4db5c89a41e857e60f9fb4ae56ca9639f9753d5ac7482667", "ja": "ちょうどいい時間に、お仕事が終わりましたので。\nみなさん、舞台挨拶お疲れさまでした。", "zh": "正好在合适的时间结束了工作。\n各位，辛苦参加舞台问候了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_07_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "13ab2eb8bb70b1531ca5a71578a3a94ef1d268569d8f57e17103be4f129b0c8a", "ja": "紬さんと、客席の後ろから見ていましたよ～。\nみなさん堂々としていて、頼もしかったです～。", "zh": "我和紬小姐从观众席后面看着呢～大家都表现得落落大方，真是令人放心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2897ececec1dd04a6364fc1ec8de632aefd84b818cac57f1b272be3a153d03b8", "ja": "映画の打ち上げは、また別にあるけど。今日は、\n軽食を用意してもらったんだ。みんなでどうぞ！", "zh": "电影的庆功宴另外还会有，不过今天，\n我准备了一些小食。大家请享用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_07_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "cd8aa7e4afd49f86b37c70067f01f7a732f4ecd55b72d1e792a5b9184eda0d44", "ja": "わぁ～！　小さなサンドイッチにスコーン、\nケーキもある！　かわいいなぁ～！", "zh": "哇～！　有小三明治和司康，\n还有蛋糕！　好可爱呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_07_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "7d069b04b7258d6a31637dd5d59cc5018a66439b80936d71f9a17ff990af3f80", "ja": "ふぅん、アフタヌーンティーがコンセプトってわけ？\n悪くないんじゃない。", "zh": "嗯～，原来概念是下午茶吗？倒也不赖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_07_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "55c1b5eded6b3440575e4d41189e932da9cb8155edd4c74eb0fa91008c51fe0b", "ja": "どれもとってもかわいくて、おいしそう……♪\nなんだか、本物のお嬢様になったみたいだな～♪", "zh": "每一样都特别可爱，看起来也很好吃……♪\n总觉得自己好像真的变成大小姐了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_07_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "f774bd3ece273eb743c13588a540ff9d5855e9632ab6dd035bb7c8b940f59474", "ja": "せっかくなら、みんな衣装姿でのティータイムを\n見たかったですけど……残念です！", "zh": "难得有这个机会，本来还想看看大家穿着演出服一起享用下午茶的样子……真遗憾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "8ff957c0d71b1bb8addab3426aa748d7e76eab44d6a0fec357d6d51c454beac5", "ja": "衣装はまだ着る予定があるし、\n汚しちゃうと困るからな。", "zh": "之后还打算再穿这套服装，弄脏了会很麻烦的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_07_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "5dbc1b7ce1f6a9f999f195c0baa967410ea141a2cf4210ed22e452f46ddfb6ae", "ja": "そういうこと！　さ、いただきましょ。\nせっかくの紅茶が冷めちゃう前にね♪", "zh": "就是这样！来，喝吧。趁这杯红茶还没凉♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "6b80c74f0d3d88b20ed7884e1e7bdf830ea977110255700d3eb420ffc762b43d", "ja": "（撮影は終わったけど、映画の公開はこれから……。\n大勢の人に見てもらえるように頑張らないとな！）", "zh": "（拍摄结束了，但电影的上映才刚刚开始……得努力让更多人看到才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
